# Temporarily Suspending the Radio

Before playing a doorbell, alarm, or local notification, store whether the radio was active:

```yaml
- variables:
    radio_was_playing: >
      {{ is_state('media_player.aqara_m1s_local_radio', 'playing') }}
```

Stop the radio only if it was playing:

```yaml
- if:
    - condition: template
      value_template: "{{ radio_was_playing }}"
  then:
    - action: media_player.media_stop
      continue_on_error: true
      target:
        entity_id: media_player.aqara_m1s_local_radio

    - delay: "00:00:01"
```

Restart it after the local audio path has been released:

```yaml
- if:
    - condition: template
      value_template: >
        {{ radio_was_playing and
           is_state('input_boolean.aqara_alarma_ruleaza', 'off') }}
  then:
    - delay: "00:00:03"

    - action: media_player.media_stop
      continue_on_error: true
      target:
        entity_id: media_player.aqara_m1s_local_radio

    - delay: "00:00:02"

    - action: media_player.play_media
      continue_on_error: true
      target:
        entity_id: media_player.aqara_m1s_local_radio
      data:
        media_content_id: "https://live.radiocafe.ro:8443/live.aac"
        media_content_type: music
```

The extra stop before restarting forces the integration to recreate the audio session.

